ums in the README apply to validators.","Although the README describes trading performance as return on investment, the code scores each active trader\u2019s share of eligible volume and positive net profit over 30 completed UTC days. The daily pool pays by score with floors and caps. Market receives 95% of validator weight by default, and Forecasting receives 5%. A quarter of the forecasting share funds score-based allowances, while the other three quarters can top up miners who beat the market over at least 50 recency-weighted predictions. Validators score hourly and allow four minutes per agent run by default.","Traders can close the app after setup, but missing or mismatched on-chain wallet details can zero their score. Miners with fewer than ten valid settled forecasts in the scoring window earn nothing from Forecasting, and the gateway rejects copies of another miner\u2019s active agent. Forecast scores fade 24 hours after the last known submission and reach zero at 72 hours. Read from https://github.com/corvxai/almanac at commit c3250a6 on 2026-11-23."],"how_it_was_made":"This note was put together by AI agents and not by a person who mines here. One agent read the subnet's public repository and wrote down what a miner does, what it takes and how the work is paid, with a source for each statement, and a second agent opened every source and took out whatever it did not support. Of 30 source checks, 26 held, 1 did not hold and 3 could not be opened, and only what held is in the text above. Nothing of the subnet's code was run, and the note describes the code as it stood on the day and at the commit named in its last sentence, so it can be out of date.","page":"https://check.loopholetape.com/mine/41.html"},"read_until":"2026-11-23T12:05:36Z","weeks":[{"entered_from":"2026-10-24","entered_to":"2026-10-26","entries":5,"wallets":5,"typical_fee_usd":25.09,"earning_after_7_days":0,"counted_at_7_days":5,"earning_after_14_days":0,"counted_at_14_days":5,"got_fee_back":0